\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 Legacy and Impact\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Steve Jobs passed away in 2011, but his legacy endures. He proved that consumers care deeply about design and that intuitive, beautifully crafted products could change the world. His famous commencement address at Stanford University urged people to "stay hungry, stay foolish," a philosophy that continues to inspire innovators globally. Jobs didn't just build devices; he engineered experiences that reshaped modern life.\
